# Deploy master-production

Full runbook: [docs/deploy-master-production.md](docs/deploy-master-production.md)

## Hard rules

- Go-live branch is **`master-production`** only (merge from `master` first via `deploy.ps1`).
- **Never discard local work** on the dev machine: no local `git reset --hard`, `checkout -f`, or `git clean`. Preflight aborts with a file list if the tree is dirty; `-AllowDirty` only skips local sync (server still deploys). Prefer a **separate clean git worktree** for deploys.
- Touch **only** compose project `nsoft3-prod` / containers `nsoft3-*`. Never stop/restart Portainer, pustaka, andromedia, ipustah, beapi, or other host apps unless the user explicitly asks.
- Published ports only: `8090`, `3013`, `3011`, `9010`.
- Secrets (`SSH_PASS`, `GITHUB_TOKEN`, `.env.master-production`) stay in env / gitignored files — never commit, never echo full secrets in chat.

## Command (from repo root, Windows)

```powershell
$env:SSH_HOST="31.97.66.39"
$env:SSH_USER="root"
$env:SSH_PASS="********"
$env:GITHUB_TOKEN="ghp_********"   # or DEPLOY_GIT_URL=git@github.com:spygunpro/nusantarasoft-3.git
$env:PYTHONIOENCODING="utf-8"
powershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File scripts/master-production/deploy.ps1
```

- After merge/push already done: add `-SkipMerge -SkipPush` (working tree must still be clean unless `-AllowDirty`).
- `-AllowDirty`: skip all local git steps; never modifies local files.
- Server path: `/opt/nusantarasoft-3`.
- Redeploy ends with Hermes kasir posture restore (`hermes-kasir-posture.py`), `docker restart nsoft3-nginx` to avoid stale upstream 502, optional `prune-nsoft3-images.sh` when `NSOFT3_PRUNE_IMAGES=1` (default off), then **`smoke-umkm.sh`** (GraphQL, kasir-consult auth/probe, Hermes WA, posture check — no ledger/WA sends). `pull-on-server.sh` backs up and stash/restores `volumes/hermes` across hard reset.

## Verify

- `http://31.97.66.39:3013` (admin)
- `http://31.97.66.39:8090` (landing/nginx)
- GraphQL `POST /graphql` on `:8090` returns 200
- `bash scripts/master-production/smoke-umkm.sh` exit 0 on server
- `docker ps` shows non-nsoft3 apps still Up
